{
  "title": "ISic000082. A possible Byzantine boundary stone",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Massa\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Massa\">M(assa?)</span>  <span data-text=\"Picianensis\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Picianensis\">Pici<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">an</span>(ensis)</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Petri\"><span data-text=\"Petri\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Petrus\">[P]etri</span></span>  <span data-text=\"baculum\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"baculum\">ba<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">c</span>(u)<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">l</span>(um)</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Massa\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Massa\">Massa</span>  <span data-text=\"Picianensis\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Picianensis\">Picianensis</span>  <span data-text=\"Petri\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Petrus\">Petri</span>  <span data-text=\"baculum\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"baculum\">baculum</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Massa\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Massa\">M</span><span data-text=\"Picianensis\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Picianensis\">PICI<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">AN</span></span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Petri\"><span data-text=\"Petri\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Petrus\">[.]ETRI</span></span><span data-text=\"baculum\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"baculum\">BA<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">C</span><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">L</span></span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Massa\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Massa\">MASSA</span><span data-text=\"Picianensis\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Picianensis\">PICIANENSIS</span><span data-text=\"Petri\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Petrus\">PETRI</span><span data-text=\"baculum\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"baculum\">BACULUM</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000082_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2024-12-03\" src=\"ISic000082_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000082.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2024-12-03\" src=\"ISic000082-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text of Bivona 1995</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2> translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Giustolisi speculates that the C in line 2 might be a lunate sigma and so 'basilica' instead, but this seems rather hard to sustain without stronger grounds for the suggestion. The suggestion of Bivona is that this marks the boundary of a property of a church of St Peter.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Bivona 1995 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002136\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002136</a>  </li><li> 1996 811 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283</a>  </li><li> Bivona 1997-1998 614 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002144\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002144</a>  </li><li> Giustolisi 1999 17 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001944\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001944</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
